<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Royal Bank of Canada cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Royal Bank of Canada cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded its rating of Royal Bank of Canada to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 3/4 to 36-3/8 on the New York Stock Exchange in early trading on Monday.</p>
</text>
